{"symbol":"PTW.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:55:58Z","info":{"address1":"International Congress Center","address2":"Plac Slawika i Antalla 1","city":"Katowice","zip":"40-163","country":"Poland","phone":"48 32 209 1303","website":"https://www.ptwp.pl","industry":"Publishing","industryKey":"publishing","industryDisp":"Publishing","sector":"Communication Services","sectorKey":"communication-services","sectorDisp":"Communication Services","longBusinessSummary":"Polskie Towarzystwo Wspierania Przedsiebiorczosci S.A. provides integrated solutions for business communication in Poland. The company publishes specialized journals and occasional publications for middle and senior management, opinion leaders, representatives of state and local governments, physicians, and healthcare managers under the Farmer, Nowy Przemysl, Rynek Zdrowia, and Property Magazine names. It also offers advertising services through newsletters, such as wnp.pl, PortalSamorzadowy.pl, PulsHR.pl, PropertyNews.pl, PropertyDesign.pl, dlahandlu.pl, PortalSozywczy.pl, Farmer.pl, SadyOgrody.pl, RynekZdrwia.pl, InfoDENT24.pl, and RynekSeniora.pl. In addition, the company operates dlahandlu.pl, Dobrzemieszkaj.pl, Farmer.pl, Horecatrends.pl, InfoWet.pl, InfoDENT24.pl, Portaldlaedukacji.pl, PortalSamorzadowy.pl, PortalSozywczy.pl, PropertyDesign.pl, PropertyNews.pl, PulsHR.pl, RynekSeniora.pl, RynekZdrwia.pl, SadyOgrody.pl, Well.pl, and wnp.pl. Further, the company organizes congresses and industry events, as well as trade fairs and seminars. Additionally, it manages International Congress Centre in Katowice (MCK) and the Spodek Sports and Entertainment Arena. Polskie Towarzystwo Wspierania Przedsiebiorczosci S.A. was founded in 1995 and is based in Katowice, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":315,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Wojciech  Kuspik","title":"President of the Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Tomasz  Ruszkowski","title":"Member of 